  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Per COBIT 2019 BAI06.01 (Evaluate, Prioritize, and Authorize Change Requests), proper program change controls require development, testing in a non-production environment, formal approval, documentation, and controlled migration to production. This lifecycle ensures changes are validated before impacting production systems.
